From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:47:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] drm: adbe: add a KMS driver for the A9 boot display
 pipe
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adopts the disp0 pipe and mode iBoot leaves running, takes the
framebuffer over from simpledrm, and adds page flips and vblank
interrupts. It never programs timings, clocks, power or the eDP
link. The internal panel appears as eDP-1. apple_adbe_drm.enable=0
keeps simpledrm.

From the release 2 kernel of the iPad 5 port
(https://github.com/brkosebay/omarchy-ipad5), filtered for OrchardLinux.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
